<mj-text font-size="22px" line-height="30px" font-weight="bold" color="#0b0b0f">We couldn't verify your registration</mj-text>
<mj-text>Hello {{name}},</mj-text>
<mj-text>We couldn't verify the registration details on your ilovelawyer client-request profile.</mj-text>
{{#if reason}}
